From a0dbb7774735928b80f6c24e4edca4eb3f336c73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mingcong Bai <baimingcong@uniontech.com>
Date: Mon, 27 May 2024 16:27:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 119/360] arch: loongarch: update defconfig

- Disable strict /dev/mem access as required by some vendor applications.
- Refresh arch/loongarch/deepin_loongarch_desktop_defconfig.

Signed-off-by: Mingcong Bai <baimingcong@uniontech.com>
---
 .../configs/deepin_loongarch_desktop_defconfig   | 16 +++++++---------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/loongarch/configs/deepin_loongarch_desktop_defconfig b/arch/loongarch/configs/deepin_loongarch_desktop_defconfig
index 1840a22e224b..4883b7ea1b62 100644
